# ── 运行产物（可随时重新生成）──
# 约定：下划线开头 = 产物／临时件，mk_ 开头 = 生成器，candidates_*.json = 评测输入
/tools/yuqing/eval/_*
/tools/yuqing/eval/*.mjs
/tools/yuqing/eval/*_result.json
/tools/yuqing/eval/last_run.json
/_judge_*.json
/_audit_sources.json
/判定报告_*.md

# 显式保留
!/tools/yuqing/eval/mk_*.cjs
!/tools/yuqing/eval/mk_*.mjs
!/tools/yuqing/eval/candidates_*.json

# ── 通用 ──
node_modules/
*.tmp
*.bak
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
